   327	### Sigray `b_i=M_i` is not GGV `q_h`
   328	
   329	Sigray MP4 defines the pole multiplier by
   330	
   331	```text
   332	(deg p_i,deg p_{g,i}) = b_i(alpha,beta),   M_i=b_i
   333	```
   334	
   335	(`SHEET6-TDUNIFORM.md:68-74`, `SHEET6-MULTIPOLE.md:48-50`).  GGV instead
   336	defines
   337	
   338	```text
   339	q_h = v_{rho_h,sigma_h}(A_h)
