   327	   equivalence, and its topological degree is unchanged;
   328	2. \((f,g)\) is almost normalized;
   329	3. its Newton polygons lie in the rectangles with positive northeast
   330	   corners
   331	   \[
   332	   (k_f,l_f)=\alpha(b,a),\qquad
