   904	`q=alpha` also violates automatically.
   905	
   906	This explains 21 of the 22 violating rows in the filed off-axis sample. The
   907	derivation and row audit are at
   908	[`xmodel/sol-tdbound-review.md:211-257`](sol-tdbound-review.md).
   909	The sample remains useful as a census, but the violation frequency is mostly
