  1206	The exact sharp target is KME-2, and the relaxed target is KME-finite; both
  1207	require a new global Keller/proximity mechanism at divergence centers. PCC is
  1208	the most concrete sufficient mechanism found. SP is the smallest necessary
  1209	sector test for an emission-based route, not an extra assumption beyond
  1210	KME-2. Absolute book cofinality additionally requires a selected-
  1211	counterexample type cap and full-configuration landing.
  1212	
  1213	No `td` upper bound, sharp or weak, is proved here. The new proved output is
  1214	the obstruction: **the present FC5 + depth + NF-M bookkeeping is
  1215	noncoercive, even at fixed type, and the precise missing information is the
  1216	global normalized mismatch/proximity energy.**

