   421	Equality analysis at \(\mathrm{td}=\alpha\beta\): both summed
   422	inequalities and every product inequality become equalities, so
   423	\(\sum h_p^2=B^2-1\) and \(R_p=\alpha h_p\), \(S_p=\beta h_p\) at
   424	every center with \(h_p>0\), while \(h_p=0\) forces \(R_p S_p=0\).
   425	PCC is correspondingly strong. Sufficiency is proved; truth is
