8653:<p id="S7.p9.13" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p9.13.1" class="ltx_text">we obtain that <math id="S7.p9.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d|s" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo fence="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d|s</annotation></semantics></math>. Consequently we can write <math id="S7.p9.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell_{\rho,\sigma}(P)=\gamma_{2}R_{0}^{sqm/d}=\gamma_{2}(R_{0}^{s/d})^{qm}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>σ</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mn>0</mn><mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_{\rho,\sigma}(P)=\gamma_{2}R_{0}^{sqm/d}=\gamma_{2}(R_{0}^{s/d})^{qm}</annotation></semantics></math>. We conclude the proof setting <math id="S7.p9.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R:=\gamma R_{0}^{s/d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>:=</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R:=\gamma R_{0}^{s/d}</annotation></semantics></math>, where we choose <math id="S7.p9.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma\in K^{\times}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>K</mi><mo>×</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma\in K^{\times}</annotation></semantics></math> such that
8654:<math id="S7.p9.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma^{qm}=\gamma_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>γ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma^{qm}=\gamma_{2}</annotation></semantics></math>. ∎</span></p>
